WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:22.392
Hopian: I thought you three would never wake up.

2
00:00:22.393 --> 00:00:27.015
Tina: Wow, Hopian, are those your fancy clothes?

3
00:00:27.016 --> 00:00:31.992
Hopian: Yes. I wear them only on the most special occasions.

4
00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:36.839
Brad: Like when there is a Ginormous feast?

5
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.521
Bello: Handsome.

6
00:00:39.522 --> 00:00:42.853
Tina: Yes, Bello. You do look handsome.

7
00:00:42.854 --> 00:00:46.480
Brad: Hopian, we don't have any fancy clothes.

8
00:00:46.481 --> 00:00:49.358
Brad: We have only the clothes we are wearing.

9
00:00:49.359 --> 00:00:51.429
Hopian: No one will mind.

10
00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.053
You are the guests of honor.

11
00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:59.873
Tina: But we look so . . . bad.

12
00:00:59.874 --> 00:01:06.830
Danny: Hopian, do you have any more ties?

13
00:01:06.831 --> 00:01:08.203
Hopian: Here you go.

14
00:01:08.204 --> 00:01:11.211
They are too big for you, I think.

15
00:01:11.212 --> 00:01:21.027
Danny: Don't worry.

16
00:01:21.028 --> 00:01:23.772
Brad: Cool!

17
00:01:23.773 --> 00:01:26.925
Tina: But this is a boy's suit!

18
00:01:26.926 --> 00:01:29.070
Danny: I'm not perfect!

19
00:01:29.071 --> 00:01:30.613
Hopian: Come on, children!

20
00:01:30.614 --> 00:01:39.392
We can't be late.

21
00:01:39.393 --> 00:01:41.394
Hopian: Are you three ready?

22
00:01:41.395 --> 00:01:49.065
All three: You bet!

23
00:01:49.066 --> 00:01:51.330
Brad: They're bowing to us!

24
00:01:51.331 --> 00:01:53.771
Giants are bowing to us!

25
00:01:53.772 --> 00:02:01.792
Tina: This is the coolest thing ever!

26
00:02:01.793 --> 00:02:04.149
Governor: Hello, my dear friends.

27
00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:14.873
Governor: Please join me in welcoming our guests of honor, [n3@Danny, Brad, and Tina!

28
00:02:14.874 --> 00:02:19.125
Tina: Wow! All these giants are cheering for us.

29
00:02:19.126 --> 00:02:23.243
Danny: Yeah, if only the bullies at school could see us now.

30
00:02:23.244 --> 00:02:27.653
Brad: No one would believe us if we told them.

31
00:02:27.654 --> 00:02:30.095
Governor: Please be seated, everyone.

32
00:02:30.096 --> 00:02:34.814
Governor: We will now begin the honorary feast of Ginormous.

33
00:02:34.815 --> 00:02:39.293
Governor: Children, your special seats are right here.

34
00:02:39.294 --> 00:02:41.932
Brad: Um, those look a bit high.

35
00:02:41.933 --> 00:02:47.348
Tina: If you don't mind, Governor, we would rather sit on the table.

36
00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:50.909
Danny: Thanks, Hopian.

37
00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:54.964
Hopian: This is how they like to eat at my house.

38
00:02:54.965 --> 00:03:00.775
Governor: I see. Well, I guess the table will be our new seat of honor!

39
00:03:00.776 --> 00:03:10.293
Brad: All this honor is making me hungry!

40
00:03:10.294 --> 00:03:13.711
Danny: Oh my gosh! Look at all the food!

41
00:03:13.712 --> 00:03:16.183
Brad: It's a gigantic feast!

42
00:03:16.184 --> 00:03:18.918
Tina: It's an enormous feast!

43
00:03:18.919 --> 00:03:38.564
All three: It's a Ginormous feast!

44
00:03:38.565 --> 00:03:42.164
Danny: I wish this moment could last forever.

45
00:03:42.165 --> 00:03:44.806
Hopian: You know what I think, Danny?

46
00:03:44.807 --> 00:03:46.238
Danny: What?

47
00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:50.185
Hopian: I think parents will tell their children about you.

48
00:03:50.186 --> 00:03:54.260
Hopian: And those children will tell their children.

49
00:03:54.261 --> 00:04:00.497
Hopian: In the future, giants will still tell the story [n3@of Danny, Tina, and Brad.

50
00:04:00.498 --> 00:04:10.437
Hopian: This moment will last forever, Danny, because the people [n3@of Ginormous will remember it.
